# Example cron entry (Linux / macOS)
# Note: `utrader trade` acquires an internal advisory file lock in `state/<config_name>.lock`.
#
# Run Bitfinex BTC+ETH+Gold portfolio hourly at minute 2 (right after 1h candle close):
2 * * * * cd /path/to/universal-trader && /usr/bin/env uv run utrader trade --config configs/bitfinex_portfolio_btc_eth_gold.yaml >> state/cron_portfolio.log 2>&1
